WEBVTT

1
00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:09.000
Dear whoever finds this: the crabs have formed a committee.

2
00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:17.000
They meet at low tide, under the second rock from the left.

3
00:00:22.000 --> 00:00:26.000
Minutes are taken on a very small piece of kelp.

4
00:00:32.000 --> 00:00:36.000
I asked to join. They said I was too tall.

5
00:00:42.000 --> 00:00:46.000
I am writing to appeal the decision.

6
00:00:51.000 --> 00:00:55.000
Yours, from the top of the beach.
